{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras/Text_MagicalWorldGlimeria.png?t=1742322891\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a magical adventure in Karma &amp; Jonar \u2013 The Rock Trolls, a fantasy co-op  game where you and a friend take on the roles of the brave children Karma and Jonar. Despite their families being sworn enemies, they must work together to save the land of Glimeria from the forces of darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras/KJ_01.png?t=1742322891\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras/Text_KeyFeatures.png?t=1742322891\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COOP</strong>: work together to save Glimeria from the Rock trolls (features remote play together).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overcome</strong> challenges, in split screen and 2.5D-view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience</strong> a deep story around <strong>bravery</strong> and <strong>friendship.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> the magical world <i>Glimeria</i>\u00a0and discover its diversity of animals and plants.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras/KJ_02.png?t=1742322891\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras/Text_Books.png?t=1742322891\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is based on the popular children's book series, which has sold over 200,000 copies in the Nordic region and has also been adapted into an animated TV series. Now, you can experience this beloved universe in an interactive adventure that emphasizes friendship, courage, and the ability to overcome differences to fight evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather your strength and embark on an unforgettable journey in Karma &amp; Jonar \u2013 The Rock Trolls, where teamwork is the key to saving Glimeria!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras/KJ_03.png?t=1742322891\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3580060?t=1742322891","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/440dada84172009f87a61a840ae68d2825738a0b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742322891","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/9485c91cd95d0d3986d847ab19fa75e6dcb23013/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742322891","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/9485c91cd95d0d3986d847ab19fa75e6dcb23013/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742322891","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580060/extras/Text_MagicalWor